OL,3,APope admitted to hospital for surgery
OL,4,Ato remove lump on his lung
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has been admitted to
OL,7,FRome's Gemelli Hospital for surgery to
OL,8,Fremove a lump on his lung, detected
OL,9,Fduring what the Vatican has described
OL,10,Fas "routine checks".
OL,12,FIt said the operation would take place
OL,13,Fon Tuesday afternoon.
OL,15,FThe 71-year-old pontiff was met at the
OL,16,Fhospital by a large crowd, some of whom
OL,17,Fhad been waiting outside for several
OL,18,Fhours to catch a glimpse of him.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
